{
  "esm": "2.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "cdeps_datm_gswp3_data",
    "description": "The CDEPS DATM GSWP3 chain with data: the four GSWP3v1 data sources on the public NCAR CESM inputdata server (Solar FSDS, Precip PRECTmms, TPQW TBOT/PSRF/WIND/QBOT/FLDS, static topo TOPO; url_templates with {date:%Y-%m} over the archived 1901-01..2014-12 months), the GSWP3Files reader model (one data-fed parameter per file variable: the 3-hourly fields shaped over the record axis rec, so each receives the pair of records bracketing t, and the static TOPO a scalar), the Streams and Clmncep laws mounted from ./cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm, and the reader -> Streams -> Clmncep wiring (param_to_var edges; the same edges as cdeps_datm_gswp3_synthetic.esm). The Streams model computes the CDEPS time-interpolation factors from t. The time origin is 2000-01-01T00:00:00Z (domain.temporal.reference_time), the origin Streams.calday0 = 1 and the record offsets t0_* assume; the TPQW and Precip sources declare temporal.start at their first record time (01:30Z) because the records sit at 01:30, 04:30, .. Z. Carries no inline test: running it reads the real archive, and CI does not download data. The same wiring is tested on synthetic files by cdeps_datm_gswp3_synthetic.esm. No data is redistributed; the sources are referenced by URL only (GSWP3: Kim 2017, doi:10.20783/DIAS.501). Known differences from the reference CESM run: the reference cycles 1991-2010 (taxmode cycle, year_align 1991) and reads the 1991 files for model year 2000, while a data source here reads the file of the model date itself; and the bilinear map from the 0.5 deg source grid to the model mesh is not represented (the select picks one source cell).",
    "tags": [
      "data_models",
      "cdeps",
      "datm",
      "gswp3",
      "forcing",
      "data-sources"
    ],
    "created": "2026-11-20T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "EqESM project contributors"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CDEPS: Common Data model EXchange Platform source (cdeps1.0.112) - datm/datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90, streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90, streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90, share/shr_precip_mod.F90, share/shr_const_mod.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
        "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CDEPS"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Kim, H. (2017). Global Soil Wetness Project Phase 3 Atmospheric Boundary Conditions (Experiment 1) [Data set]. Data Integration and Analysis System (DIAS). The GSWP3v1 0.5x0.5 deg, 3-hourly atmospheric forcing the datm consumes, as archived on the NCAR CESM inputdata server (atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516).",
        "doi": "10.20783/DIAS.501",
        "url": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/"
      }
    ]
  },
  "domain": {
    "temporal": {
      "reference_time": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "rec": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 2,
      "records": true
    }
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "GSWP3_Solar": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/Solar/clmforc.GSWP3.c2011.0.5x0.5.Solr.{date:%Y-%m}.nc"
      },
      "temporal": {
        "start": "1901-01-01T00:00:00Z",
        "end": "2014-12-31T23:59:59Z",
        "file_period": "P1M",
        "frequency": "PT3H",
        "records_per_file": "auto",
        "time_variable": "time"
      },
      "select": {
        "axes": [
          {
            "fixed": 0
          },
          {
            "fixed": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "esio_format": "netcdf",
        "tags": [
          "gswp3",
          "datm",
          "forcing",
          "solar",
          "3-hourly"
        ],
        "description": "GSWP3v1 FSDS [W/m2], 0.5x0.5 deg (360 x 720), 3-hourly records at 00..21Z (time = 0, 0.125, .. days since the month start), the Solar stream of the I2000Clm60Sp reference case (tintalgo coszen). The select fixes (lat, lon) = (0, 0) as a placeholder cell; a consumer selects its own cell or regrids (out of scope here)."
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "Kim, H. (2017). Global Soil Wetness Project Phase 3 Atmospheric Boundary Conditions (Experiment 1) [Data set]. Data Integration and Analysis System (DIAS).",
        "doi": "10.20783/DIAS.501",
        "url": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/Solar/"
      }
    },
    "GSWP3_Precip": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/Precip/clmforc.GSWP3.c2011.0.5x0.5.Prec.{date:%Y-%m}.nc"
      },
      "temporal": {
        "start": "1901-01-01T01:30:00Z",
        "end": "2014-12-31T23:59:59Z",
        "file_period": "P1M",
        "frequency": "PT3H",
        "records_per_file": "auto",
        "time_variable": "time"
      },
      "select": {
        "axes": [
          {
            "fixed": 100
          },
          {
            "fixed": 100
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "esio_format": "netcdf",
        "tags": [
          "gswp3",
          "datm",
          "forcing",
          "precipitation",
          "3-hourly"
        ],
        "description": "GSWP3v1 PRECTmms [mm/s = kg/m2/s], 0.5x0.5 deg, 3-hourly records at 01:30..22:30Z (time = 0.0625 + 0.125 n days), the Precip stream (tintalgo nearest). The select fixes (lat, lon) = (100, 100), a mid-latitude cell with precipitation."
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "Kim, H. (2017). Global Soil Wetness Project Phase 3 Atmospheric Boundary Conditions (Experiment 1) [Data set]. Data Integration and Analysis System (DIAS).",
        "doi": "10.20783/DIAS.501",
        "url": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/Precip/"
      }
    },
    "GSWP3_TPQW": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/TPHWL/clmforc.GSWP3.c2011.0.5x0.5.TPQWL.{date:%Y-%m}.nc"
      },
      "temporal": {
        "start": "1901-01-01T01:30:00Z",
        "end": "2014-12-31T23:59:59Z",
        "file_period": "P1M",
        "frequency": "PT3H",
        "records_per_file": "auto",
        "time_variable": "time"
      },
      "select": {
        "axes": [
          {
            "fixed": 0
          },
          {
            "fixed": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "esio_format": "netcdf",
        "tags": [
          "gswp3",
          "datm",
          "forcing",
          "temperature",
          "3-hourly"
        ],
        "description": "GSWP3v1 TBOT, PSRF, QBOT, WIND, FLDS, 0.5x0.5 deg, 3-hourly records at 01:30..22:30Z, the TPQW stream (tintalgo linear). The select fixes (lat, lon) = (0, 0)."
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "Kim, H. (2017). Global Soil Wetness Project Phase 3 Atmospheric Boundary Conditions (Experiment 1) [Data set]. Data Integration and Analysis System (DIAS).",
        "doi": "10.20783/DIAS.501",
        "url": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/atm_forcing.datm7.GSWP3.0.5d.v1.c170516/TPHWL/"
      }
    },
    "GSWP3_Topo": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/topo_forcing/topodata_0.9x1.25_USGS_070110_stream_c151201.nc"
      },
      "select": {
        "axes": [
          "all",
          {
            "fixed": 0
          },
          {
            "fixed": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      "metadata": {
        "esio_format": "netcdf",
        "tags": [
          "topography",
          "static"
        ],
        "description": "USGS surface topography TOPO [m] on the 0.9x1.25 deg grid (192 x 288), the topo.observed stream (tintalgo lower); one record on a degenerate time dimension of length 1. The source is static (no temporal block), so its select names every native dimension: the degenerate time axis (\"all\" - the netcdf reader refuses a subset of a time dimension) and the (lat, lon) cell."
      },
      "reference": {
        "citation": "USGS 30-arc-second GTOPO30-based surface topography (TOPO), remapped to the 0.9x1.25 deg grid and archived on the NCAR CESM inputdata server.",
        "url": "https://svn-ccsm-inputdata.cgd.ucar.edu/trunk/inputdata/atm/datm7/topo_forcing/"
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "GSWP3Files": {
      "variables": {
        "FSDS": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "W/m^2",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 FSDS: total incident solar radiation, as read from the GSWP3_Solar source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.swdn_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_Solar",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "FSDS"
            }
          }
        },
        "PRECTmms": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/m^2/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 PRECTmms: total precipitation rate (mm H2O/s = kg/m2/s), as read from the GSWP3_Precip source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.precn_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_Precip",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "PRECTmms"
            }
          }
        },
        "TBOT": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 TBOT: temperature at the lowest atmospheric level, as read from the GSWP3_TPQW source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.tbot_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_TPQW",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "TBOT"
            }
          }
        },
        "PSRF": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "Pa",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 PSRF: surface pressure at the lowest atmospheric level, as read from the GSWP3_TPQW source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.pbot_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_TPQW",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "PSRF"
            }
          }
        },
        "WIND": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m/s",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 WIND: wind speed at the lowest atmospheric level, as read from the GSWP3_TPQW source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.wind_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_TPQW",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "WIND"
            }
          }
        },
        "QBOT": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "kg/kg",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 QBOT: specific humidity at the lowest atmospheric level, as read from the GSWP3_TPQW source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.shum_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_TPQW",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "QBOT"
            }
          }
        },
        "FLDS": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "W/m^2",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "rec"
          ],
          "description": "GSWP3 FLDS: incident longwave radiation, as read from the GSWP3_TPQW source. Shaped over the record axis rec, so at time t it receives the pair of records bracketing t, [the record at or before t (CDEPS LB), the next record (UB)] (esm-spec 8.5.1); the param_to_var edge to Streams.lwdn_rec (declared with the same shape) hands the pair to the stream layer. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_TPQW",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "FLDS"
            }
          }
        },
        "TOPO": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "GSWP3 TOPO: surface topography height, as read from the static GSWP3_Topo source: declared a scalar (shape []), so it receives the file's single record (esm-spec 8.5.1). Feeds Streams.topo_in. Read from the public NCAR CESM inputdata archive.",
          "shape": [],
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "GSWP3_Topo",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "TOPO"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "equations": []
    },
    "Streams": {
      "ref": "./cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm",
      "model": "Streams"
    },
    "Clmncep": {
      "ref": "./cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm",
      "model": "Clmncep"
    }
  },
  "coupling": [
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.FSDS",
      "to": "Streams.swdn_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 FSDS records -> stream-layer input swdn_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.PRECTmms",
      "to": "Streams.precn_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 PRECTmms records -> stream-layer input precn_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.TBOT",
      "to": "Streams.tbot_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 TBOT records -> stream-layer input tbot_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.PSRF",
      "to": "Streams.pbot_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 PSRF records -> stream-layer input pbot_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.WIND",
      "to": "Streams.wind_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 WIND records -> stream-layer input wind_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.QBOT",
      "to": "Streams.shum_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 QBOT records -> stream-layer input shum_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.FLDS",
      "to": "Streams.lwdn_rec",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 FLDS records -> stream-layer input lwdn_rec."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "GSWP3Files.TOPO",
      "to": "Streams.topo_in",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "GSWP3 TOPO records -> stream-layer input topo_in."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.swdn",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_swdn",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value swdn -> datamode input strm_swdn (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.precn",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_precn",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value precn -> datamode input strm_precn (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.tbot",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_tbot",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value tbot -> datamode input strm_tbot (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.pbot",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_pbot",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value pbot -> datamode input strm_pbot (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.wind",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_wind",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value wind -> datamode input strm_wind (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.shum",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_shum",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value shum -> datamode input strm_shum (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.lwdn",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_lwdn",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value lwdn -> datamode input strm_lwdn (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    },
    {
      "type": "variable_map",
      "from": "Streams.topo",
      "to": "Clmncep.strm_topo",
      "transform": "param_to_var",
      "description": "Interpolated stream value topo -> datamode input strm_topo (the strm_* pointer of datm_datamode_clmncep_advance)."
    }
  ]
}
